# Skill: refactor-async

Use this skill when optimizing synchronous operations to async/await.
## Procedure

1. Read the target function and identify all async boundaries.
2. Check callers — they may need to become async too.
3. Replace `.then(fn)` with `await` and `.catch(fn)` with `try/catch`, adding `async` to the signature.
4. Run the test suite and confirm all callers still work.
